<style>
.page-width:has(.mj-about),
.page-width--about {
  max-width: 1220px !important;
  padding-left: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 32px) !important;
  padding-right: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 32px) !important;
}

.mj-about {
  --mj-green: #142a20;
  --mj-cream: #faf6ef;
  --mj-gold: #8e6a2b;
  --mj-ink: #1a241f;
  --mj-muted: #38463f;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 44px 0 96px;
  color: var(--mj-ink);
  font-family: inherit;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.mj-about * {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.mj-about h1,
.mj-about h2 {
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--mj-green);
  line-height: 1.18;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.mj-about h1 {
  font-size: clamp(40px, 4.2vw, 54px) !important;
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 14px !important;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-eyebrow {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: clamp(13px, 1.4vw, 15px) !important;
  letter-spacing: 0.24em !important;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--mj-gold);
  font-weight: 700 !important;
  margin-bottom: 64px !important;
}
.mj-about h2 {
  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 38px) !important;
  line-height: 1.2 !important;
  margin-bottom: 20px !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-chapter {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px);
  align-items: center !important;
  margin-bottom: 84px !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-chapter:nth-of-type(even) .mj-img {
  order: 2;
}
.mj-about .mj-img {
  margin: 0 !important;
  width: 100% !important;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9 !important;
  max-height: 480px !important;
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
  border-radius: 14px !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  background: var(--mj-cream);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(20, 42, 32, 0.08) !important;
  border: 1px solid rgba(184, 151, 104, 0.22) !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-img img {
  width: 100% !important;
  height: 100% !important;
  object-fit: contain !important;
  object-position: center !important;
  display: block !important;
  border-radius: 14px !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-text {
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-text p {
  margin: 0 0 18px !important;
  font-size: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 20.5px) !important;
  line-height: 1.82 !important;
  color: #1a2620 !important;
  max-width: 100% !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-text p:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0 !important;
}
.mj-about .mj-quote {
  color: var(--mj-green);
  font-style: italic;
}
.mj-about .mj-close {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 960px;
  margin: 56px auto 72px;
  padding: 44px 36px !important;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #1e4535 0%, #11261d 100%) !important;
  border-radius: 20px !important;
  border: 1px solid rgba(226, 199, 142, 0.35) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(18, 44, 34, 0.18) !important;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.mj-about .mj-close::before {
  content: "“";
  position: absolute;
  top: -24px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 150px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.mj-about .mj-close p {
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
  font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 32px) !important;
  line-height: 1.48 !important;
  color: #FAF6ED !important;
  margin: 0 auto 16px !important;
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  max-width: 760px;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.mj-about .mj-close .mj-sign {
  font-size: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 13.5px) !important;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em !important;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #E2C78E !important;
  font-weight: 700;
  display: inline-block;
  padding-top: 14px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(226, 199, 142, 0.35);
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.mj-about .mj-biz {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FAF7F2 0%, #F5EFE6 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(184, 151, 104, 0.28);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 48px 40px !important;
  text-align: left;
  max-width: 860px !important;
  margin: 0 auto;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(20, 42, 32, 0.05);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.mj-about .mj-biz::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 3px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #142a20 0%, #b89768 50%, #142a20 100%);
}
.mj-about .mj-biz h2 {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 2.8vw, 32px) !important;
  color: var(--mj-green) !important;
  margin-bottom: 24px !important;
  padding-bottom: 14px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 151, 104, 0.2);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}
.mj-about .mj-biz-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.mj-about .mj-biz p {
  margin: 0 !important;
  font-size: clamp(15.5px, 1.5vw, 17px) !important;
  color: #2b3a32 !important;
  line-height: 1.75 !important;
  font-weight: 450;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 10px;
}
.mj-about .mj-biz-icon {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  color: var(--mj-gold);
  margin-top: 2px;
  font-size: 15px;
}
.mj-about .mj-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 14px 34px !important;
  min-height: 48px;
  background: #142a20;
  color: #ffffff !important;
  text-decoration: none;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 13.5px !important;
  font-weight: 600;
  border: 1px solid #142a20;
  border-radius: 9999px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(20, 42, 32, 0.18);
  transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.mj-about .mj-btn:hover,
.mj-about .mj-btn:focus-visible {
  background: #1e3d30;
  color: #FAF6ED !important;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(20, 42, 32, 0.24);
}
.mj-about .mj-btn svg {
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}
.mj-about .mj-btn:hover svg {
  transform: translateX(3px);
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .mj-about {
    padding: 32px 14px 64px;
  }
  .mj-about h1 {
    font-size: 34px !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px !important;
    margin-bottom: 40px !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em !important;
  }
  .mj-about h2 {
    font-size: 26px !important;
    margin-bottom: 14px !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-chapter {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 64px !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-chapter:nth-of-type(even) .mj-img {
    order: 0;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-img {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9 !important;
    max-height: none !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-text p {
    font-size: 17px !important;
    line-height: 1.75 !important;
    margin-bottom: 16px !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-close p {
    font-size: 23px !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-close .mj-sign {
    font-size: 13px !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-biz {
    padding: 36px 20px !important;
  }
  .mj-about .mj-biz p {
    font-size: 15px !important;
  }
}
</style>

<div class="mj-about">
  <h1>A Place At The Table</h1>
  <span class="mj-eyebrow">The story behind Mahjiva</span>

  <section class="mj-chapter">
    <figure class="mj-img">
      <img src="{{ img1_src | default: 'IMAGE_URL_1' }}" alt="Friends gathered around an ivory mahjong mat with floral tiles, sunlight falling across the table" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">
    </figure>
    <div class="mj-text">
      <h2>The Invitation</h2>
      <p>Claire had recently moved into the neighborhood when Frank invited her over for Mahjong.</p>
      <p>“I don’t know how to play,” she said.</p>
      <p>“Come anyway. We’ll show you.”</p>
      <p>At his house, sunlight fell across an ivory mat and delicate floral tiles. Maya moved her bag to make room. Evelyn offered Claire a cookie. Frank poured her tea.</p>
      <p>Before the first hand began, Claire already knew everyone’s name.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mj-chapter">
    <figure class="mj-img">
      <img src="{{ img2_src | default: 'IMAGE_URL_2' }}" alt="Claire holding a mahjong tile while her new friends explain the game with encouraging smiles" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">
    </figure>
    <div class="mj-text">
      <h2>The Hand That Made Room</h2>
      <p>A little later, Claire paused with a tile between her fingers.</p>
      <p>“I’m afraid I’m slowing everyone down.”</p>
      <p>Frank smiled. “Then we’ll take our time.”</p>
      <p>Evelyn explained it again. Maya shared a story about her own first game. Soon, Claire was asking questions without apologizing.</p>
      <p>Between hands, they talked about gardens, favorite recipes, and the neighborhood. By the end of the afternoon, Claire felt part of the group.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mj-chapter">
    <figure class="mj-img">
      <img src="{{ img3_src | default: 'IMAGE_URL_3' }}" alt="Claire hosting her own mahjong afternoon with a prepared table, tea and a lemon cake" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">
    </figure>
    <div class="mj-text">
      <h2>The Beginning of Mahjiva</h2>
      <p>A few weeks later, Frank received a message from Claire.</p>
      <p>“Saturday at mine? I’ll put the kettle on.”</p>
      <p>She prepared the table and baked a lemon cake with Evelyn’s advice. This time, she was welcoming everyone in.</p>
      <p>For Frank, that afternoon sparked an idea: thoughtfully designed Mahjong pieces could make gathering feel even more special.</p>
      <p>That belief inspired him to create Mahjiva—expressive tiles and coordinating accessories that bring personality to the table and celebrate the connections around it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mj-close">
    <p>Grace lives in the care we put into our tables and the kindness we share across them.</p>
    <span class="mj-sign">Mahjiva — Grace in Every Hand</span>
  </div>

  <aside class="mj-biz" aria-labelledby="mj-biz-title">
    <h2 id="mj-biz-title">
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--mj-gold);"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
      Business Information
    </h2>
    <div class="mj-biz-meta">
      <p>
        <span class="mj-biz-icon">✦</span>
        <span>Mahjiva is owned and operated by FR SUMMER LLC, a company registered in the United States.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="mj-biz-icon">✦</span>
        <span>Founder &amp; Creative Director: Frank R.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="mj-biz-icon">✦</span>
        <span>Business Address: 1401 Pennsylvania Ave Ste 105 5132, Wilmington, DE 19806-4125, USA.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="mj-btn" href="/pages/contact">
      <span>Contact Us</span>
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
    </a>
